{"key": "[\"Sixteen great realms divide the north. Some have kings. Others, like the Vajjis of Vaishali, by assemblies of clans. Magadha has iron in its hills and the Ganga at its door, and it swallows its neighbours one by one. Its capital, Rajagriha, sits in a ring of five hills. Here the Buddha spends many rainy seasons.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/rajagriha-magadha.mp3", "duration": 22.02175, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "Sixteen"}, {"t": 0.3932455357142857, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "great"}, {"t": 0.7864910714285714, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "realms"}, {"t": 1.1797366071428572, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "divide"}, {"t": 1.5729821428571429, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "the"}, {"t": 1.9662276785714285, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "north."}, {"t": 2.3594732142857144, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "Some"}, {"t": 2.75271875, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "have"}, {"t": 3.1459642857142858, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "kings."}, {"t": 3.5392098214285714, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "Others,"}, {"t": 3.932455357142857, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "like"}, {"t": 4.325700892857143, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "the"}, {"t": 4.718946428571429, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "Vajjis"}, {"t": 5.1121919642857145, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "of"}, {"t": 5.5054375, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "Vaishali,"}, {"t": 5.898683035714286, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "by"}, {"t": 6.2919285714285715, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "assemblies"}, {"t": 6.685174107142857, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "of"}, {"t": 7.078419642857143, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "clans."}, {"t": 7.4716651785714285, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "Magadha"}, {"t": 7.864910714285714, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "has"}, {"t": 8.25815625, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "iron"}, {"t": 8.651401785714286, "d": 0.3932455357142857, "w": "in"}, {"t": 9.